# SolNeutral V6 | Wallet-first research and DEVNET trading workspace
# Optional PRIVATE RPC URL for the read-only Wallet Lens.
# Mainnet only. Store provider API keys as Vercel environment variables.
# Do NOT prefix this with NEXT_PUBLIC_ (would expose your key in browser builds).
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://your-private-mainnet-rpc-provider.example/?api-key=YOUR_KEY
# With this unset, public https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com is attempted;
# it may rate-limit or reject requests. Missing observations will show unavailable.

# Optional evidence-bound Anthropic language model. Leave all three unset for the
# free deterministic analyst. NEVER prefix these with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=your-approved-current-model-name
# AI_DEMO_ACCESS_TOKEN=minimum-20-character-random-private-code
# Important: rate limit/authenticate paid public inference before an open launch.

# DEVNET-only browser execution lab. Browser-visible RPC URLs are public.
# Avoid using private API keys unless the RPC provider supports origin restrictions.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEVNET_RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
# To disable ALL devnet transaction controls without changing the code:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_DEVNET_TRADING=false
# Do NOT put a mainnet RPC URL here. App checks the devnet genesis hash and fails closed.
# No configuration enables real-money pooled vault deposits.
